{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/513351b5c04b34c219707a2a657ce2a1.poster.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/513351b5c04b34c219707a2a657ce2a1.webm?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/513351b5c04b34c219707a2a657ce2a1.mp4?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build powerful towers, protect your base, and crush robots without mercy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine unique towers, choose the best locations, and face increasingly difficult waves. Thinking fast and acting smart is the key to survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/24108c40e8514d8b7c8180444323759d.poster.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/24108c40e8514d8b7c8180444323759d.webm?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/24108c40e8514d8b7c8180444323759d.mp4?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/8047084d0f1ec3ac4fd8b155642cf76a.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1406 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the van, floor the accelerator, and execute precise drifts to escape the chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run over enemies, place towers in the heat of battle, and dominate the road as chaos erupts all around you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/387ed82abb767c358bb6d08db70c9296.poster.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/387ed82abb767c358bb6d08db70c9296.webm?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/387ed82abb767c358bb6d08db70c9296.mp4?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/59a5f7da7314ab0f9a69990b5dd14d92.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1406 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage introduces new mechanics and obstacles designed to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions, unlock dozens of achievements, and challenge your friends to see who can go the farthest in Infinite Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/77e05b3cc9ddccb5b0d576d765dc942f.poster.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/77e05b3cc9ddccb5b0d576d765dc942f.webm?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/77e05b3cc9ddccb5b0d576d765dc942f.mp4?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/46a5c41b277321b4040db2245a3594c8.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1406 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your vehicle throughout the journey and turn the van into a true war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost durability, speed, and impact, unlock defensive upgrades, and install an <strong>automatic sentry machine gun</strong> to eliminate enemies while you focus on driving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/0175512132587254bbf0273a48e82112.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1410 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly dangerous enemies as you push forward through a living, hostile city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps, survive unpredictable scenarios, and endure extreme situations \u2014 including a runaway train racing across deadly tracks, ready to crush everything in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/273c22ed47332f06366a7e39a4ea91a1.poster.avif?t=1774018554\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/273c22ed47332f06366a7e39a4ea91a1.webm?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450120/extras/273c22ed47332f06366a7e39a4ea91a1.mp4?t=1774018554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\